[38;2;124;124;124mSo the hook sums are i^{r-c} * {±(1+i), ±(1-i)}, and the possible values are the[0m[38;2;124;124;124msame {±(1+i), ±(1-i)} regardless of r-c.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mFor S = 2, H = 6: need 6 values from {±(1+i), ±(1-i)} summing to 2 = (2, 0).[0m

