[38;2;124;124;124m(r+2)*(row 2 count) = r*6 + (row 1 count) + 2*(row 2 count) = 6r + b + 2c (where[0m[38;2;124;124;124m(a,b,c) is the row count pattern).[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mThe total row moment = Σ (6r_i + b_i + 2c_i) = 6 * Σ r_i + Σ b_i + 2 * Σ c_i.[0m

